  "releaseNotes": "Prepares the Asset Store edition with SocketJack.Multiplayer code namespaces, namespaced samples and Tools/SocketJack editor menus. Existing consumers must update using directives from SocketJack.Unity to SocketJack.Multiplayer; package and assembly identity remain SocketJack.Unity. Includes local physics prediction, interpolation/extrapolation, binary inputs, reliable unordered UDP, automatic MTU-safe reconstruction, topology/authority options and automatic UPnP mapping.",
